        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/k2IcsqAkpxe0IsRjg6eNvFF9waAuQqFRgx1f9pwrsCVjy4M3TvDfQfX6aDLJM2B24cQpa_Gd2LvOmBijbvPon2KNJNgD_Q4JCwBxyRq_YrMIjds2g7P1Ak6jlIZjgmrCLhJj7RXt8HxoxKH-H_OnyrS7-K0ywjwiP_kJ0AT3uBgnFVDLAD7afVUPsjCuGbEbpXNDhOeL26VbYgGRpcebWNek28sRBhTAjki3AVK0dcvQf8G3bB65u57qShfe6LTARCZkbnob0VkKln5V57SV85bR0iYVzq2cd0CUFbe1Wx5BknLKYUXHjZgjrvtfER-Z4EB7ORogdx4CAKlcO5Yiag.jpg"
      },
      "sourceId": "eg:medmannews",
